                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I only downloaded this game because you can export your cars to BeamNG. and Im glad i did so.\n\nCustomization is Vast, Tuning and car develupment is In depth and mods are so accessable and add a bunch of assets and fixtures.\n\nEven if you don't have BeanNG, the career mode and gameplay is also in depth, you need to follow fuel laws, choose what car type you're making, etc! \n\nThe ONLY thing I wish they added was more variation to engine sounds, V8s dont need to sound like muscle cars all the time.",
